+
+// Tark (D4): the call captions pill (mockup pill-states.html, steps 1-3):
+// the caption box (last final line and a faded draft) above a pill with
+// the mark, Captions, the language, Translate (disabled until Phase 2) and
+// ✕. In strip mode (the call's tab is not in front) only a narrower
